Also something I didn't know until very recently, the Valk quest 
artifact (Orb of Fate) acts as a luckstone, so you don't need to carry 
any after you get it (if by some miracle you make it that far). Don't 
use it as a sling stone though. ;)

If you have 10 luck without a luckstone and you're already crowned, drop 
the luckstone when you pray on an altar. The extra luck increases your 
chance of being crowned, but if you already have been then nothing will 
happen. So by dropping it you're a little more likely to get another 
cool favor.

